const _evj4EN: Dict = { "mev.dugunmev":"Wedding season: jewelry and kaftans are flying off the stalls.","mev.balikakin":"A fish run in the river: stalls are full, prices hit the floor.","mev.gocmenakini":"A displaced caravan of families came down to the city: bread and hot soup are in demand.","mev.kirkimzamani":"The shearing was bountiful: wool by the sackful, and the price fell.","evj.harvestShare":"The harvest event visited your %1 holdings too; a share fell to your purse (+%2 akçe).","mev.peynirmev":"Back from the high pastures: skin-bag cheese is plentiful and the cauldrons are bubbling — prices eased.","mev.gemiyatti":"The storm battered the pier and the boats stayed tied up: fish and meat grew dear.","mev.kithasat":"Poor harvest: grain prices have soared.", "mev.bolluk":"Bountiful harvest: grain has grown cheap.", "mev.savas":"Rumor of war: arms and iron grow dear.", "mev.kervanb":"Caravan raided: luxury goods are scarce.", "mev.kuraklik":"Drought: food prices have risen.", "mev.loncagrev":"The smiths' guild is on strike: tools and arms grow scarce.", "mev.panayir":"A fair in town: festival wares are snapped up.", "mev.ipekkerv":"A silk caravan arrives from the east: luxury goods grow cheap.", "mev.yolkapan":"The passes are closed: hauling everything grows costly.", "mev.bagbozumu":"Vintage time: wine and honey are plentiful.", "mev.deritalep":"The tanneries crave hides: leather goods grow dear.", "mev.koyunveba":"Sheep plague: wool and meat prices have risen.", "mev.ormanyang":"Forest fire: timber and woodwork grow costly.", "mev.sogukdalg":"Harsh winter: fuel and hot meals are sought after.", "mev.balbolluk":"The hives thrived on the high pastures: honey abounds and remedies grew cheaper.","mev.tuzyolu":"The salt road is cut: brine goods and winter stores grew dear.","mev.madendam":"A new ore vein: iron and ironwork grow cheap.", "wev.demirci.4.t":"A seized-up lock","wev.demirci.4.win":"You opened the rusted lock without breaking it; the caravanserai warden stared in wonder","wev.demirci.4.lose":"The lock held fast and the tongs flew from your hand","wev.tüccar.4.t":"An accusation of rigged scales","wev.tüccar.4.win":"You had the scales inspected before the qadi yourself; your name became a byword for honesty","wev.tüccar.4.lose":"The suspicion lingered and the stall stood empty that day","wev.çiftçi.4.t":"Irrigation-ditch duty","wev.çiftçi.4.win":"You mended the weir before your turn came; your field drank first","wev.çiftçi.4.lose":"The spade stuck fast in the mud and the day was wasted","wev.asker.4.t":"Word of smugglers","wev.asker.4.win":"You laid the ambush at the pass; the smugglers were taken with their goods","wev.asker.4.lose":"The tip proved false and the night was wasted on watch","wev.şifacı.4.t":"An apprentice with a broken arm","wev.şifacı.4.win":"You set the bone on the first try; the master left a pouch of honey","wev.şifacı.4.lose":"The apprentice fainted from the pain and your hand shook","wev.avcı.4.t":"An empty trap line","wev.avcı.4.win":"Reading the tracks, you moved the line to the creek mouth; two fox pelts by evening","wev.avcı.4.lose":"The traps stood empty again; your teeth chattered in the frost","wev.müzisyen.4.t":"The deaf elder song","wev.müzisyen.4.win":"You found and played the elder song of youth; his eyes welled up and the purse opened","wev.müzisyen.4.lose":"You could not catch the tune; the elder gazed off absently","wev.hancı.4.t":"Two feuding caravaneers","wev.hancı.4.win":"You seated them apart and made the peace; both doubled their tips","wev.hancı.4.lose":"The brawl spilled into the courtyard; jugs were smashed","wev.kuyumcu.4.t":"Repairing an old seal","wev.kuyumcu.4.win":"You recut the faded engraving true to the original; the owner paid double","wev.kuyumcu.4.lose":"The fine point slipped and the engraving was spoiled","wev.balıkçı.4.t":"Night fishing by lantern","wev.balıkçı.4.win":"You circled the shoal drawn to the light; baskets of fish on the shore","wev.balıkçı.4.lose":"The wind blew out the lantern; the net tangled in the dark","wev.marangoz.4.t":"A rain-beaten roof","wev.marangoz.4.win":"You replaced the beams before the storm; the house stayed dry and the owner opened his purse","wev.marangoz.4.lose":"A plank slipped and struck your knee","wev.çoban.4.t":"Newborn twin lambs","wev.çoban.4.win":"You set the rejected lamb to nurse from another ewe; both lambs lived","wev.çoban.4.lose":"The frail lamb did not see the morning","wev.fırıncı.4.t":"Mouldering flour sacks","wev.fırıncı.4.win":"You culled the mould in time; the sound flour saved the day","wev.fırıncı.4.lose":"A whole sack was lost and the books ran short","wev.katip.4.t":"What the burnt archive left","wev.katip.4.win":"You dried the smoke-stained pages and copied them anew; the qadi was pleased","wev.katip.4.lose":"The ink smeared with soot and the lines became unreadable","wev.dokumacı.4.t":"A master work left half-done","wev.dokumacı.4.win":"You worked out the late master pattern on the loom and finished the cloth; the family gave blessings","wev.dokumacı.4.lose":"The pattern knot would not yield; the loom still waits","wev.demirci.3.t":"A broken plowshare", "wev.demirci.3.win":"You mended the iron without reforging; the farmer watched in wonder", "wev.demirci.3.lose":"The iron cracked a second time", "wev.tüccar.3.t":"A rain-soaked bale", "wev.tüccar.3.win":"You sold the wet cloth as a rare faded dye", "wev.tüccar.3.lose":"You offloaded the bale at a loss", "wev.çiftçi.3.t":"A runaway goat herd", "wev.çiftçi.3.win":"You coaxed the goats out of the field; their owner left you a skin of cheese", "wev.çiftçi.3.lose":"The goats ate the seedlings clean", "wev.asker.3.t":"An escaped prisoner", "wev.asker.3.win":"You traced him to the mill; the prisoner was caught before he could flee", "wev.asker.3.lose":"The trail went cold and you took a scolding", "wev.şifacı.3.t":"Two patients, one remedy", "wev.şifacı.3.win":"You split the remedy and raised them both to their feet", "wev.şifacı.3.lose":"The choice kept you awake all night", "wev.demirci.t":"A demanding order", "wev.demirci.win":"You finished the grueling order with mastery", "wev.demirci.lose":"Your hand was crushed at the anvil", "wev.tüccar.t":"A cunning customer", "wev.tüccar.win":"You won the customer over and sold at a profit", "wev.tüccar.lose":"The customer swindled you", "wev.çiftçi.t":"The weather is turning", "wev.çiftçi.win":"You gathered the harvest in time", "wev.çiftçi.lose":"The rain ruined the crop", "wev.avcı.t":"A hunt on the trail", "wev.avcı.win":"You brought down great game", "wev.avcı.lose":"The quarry slipped away and left you weary", "wev.asker.t":"A sudden patrol", "wev.asker.win":"You proved your worth on patrol", "wev.asker.lose":"You took a scratch in the skirmish", "wev.şifacı.t":"A grievously ill patient", "wev.şifacı.win":"You healed the patient and earned their prayers", "wev.şifacı.lose":"You could not save the patient", "wev.müzisyen.t":"A wedding invitation", "wev.müzisyen.win":"Your saz set the gathering ablaze with joy", "wev.müzisyen.lose":"A string snapped and you were shamed", "wev.hancı.t":"A crowded night", "wev.hancı.win":"You filled the inn to bursting", "wev.hancı.lose":"A drunken brawl broke out", "wev.kuyumcu.t":"A delicate piece of jewelry", "wev.kuyumcu.win":"Your fine craftsmanship drew praise", "wev.kuyumcu.lose":"You cracked the gemstone", "wev._.t":"An ordinary day", "wev._.win":"You did solid work and earned a little extra", "wev._.lose":"It was a weary day","wev.demirci.1.t":"Caravan horseshoes","wev.demirci.1.win":"You swung the hammer till dawn and sent the caravan on its way","wev.demirci.1.lose":"The bellows burst and the forge went cold","wev.demirci.2.t":"An order from the lord's manor","wev.demirci.2.win":"The blade came out balanced like water; your name was spoken in the manor","wev.demirci.2.lose":"The steel would not take its temper","wev.tüccar.1.t":"Rumor of famine","wev.tüccar.1.win":"You bought the goods cheap and sold them dear","wev.tüccar.1.lose":"The rumor came to nothing; the goods sat unsold","wev.tüccar.2.t":"A foreign caravan","wev.tüccar.2.win":"You befriended the caravan master and got first pick","wev.tüccar.2.lose":"The haggling turned sour; you came back empty-handed","wev.çiftçi.1.t":"The neighbor's ox","wev.çiftçi.1.win":"You borrowed the ox and plowed the field early","wev.çiftçi.1.lose":"You fell into a quarrel with the neighbor","wev.çiftçi.2.t":"Mice in the granary","wev.çiftçi.2.win":"You saved the grain in time","wev.çiftçi.2.lose":"The winter stores were gnawed through","wev.avcı.3.t":"A honey-hunting bear", "wev.avcı.3.win":"You scared the bear off with noise, the hives were saved; the villager paid in honey", "wev.avcı.3.lose":"The bear chased you up a tree; the day was lost", "wev.müzisyen.3.t":"A request for a lament", "wev.müzisyen.3.win":"Your lament seared every heart; the household sent you off with blessings", "wev.müzisyen.3.lose":"Your voice wavered; the lament was left unfinished", "wev.hancı.3.t":"A caravan caught in the snow", "wev.hancı.3.win":"At midnight you opened the gate to the caravan; the inn's name became a tale on the roads", "wev.hancı.3.lose":"The woodshed turned out empty; the guests shivered", "wev.kuyumcu.3.t":"A rush for a betrothal ring", "wev.kuyumcu.3.win":"The ring was ready by the wedding morning; two families left blessings at your door", "wev.kuyumcu.3.lose":"The size ran small; the ring came back", "wev.balıkçı.3.t":"A pod of dolphins", "wev.balıkçı.3.win":"The shoal the dolphins were driving swam straight into your net", "wev.balıkçı.3.lose":"The net tore; the day went to mending", "wev.marangoz.3.t":"The creaking bridge", "wev.marangoz.3.win":"You spotted the rotting beam before anyone and replaced it; the headman came to give thanks", "wev.marangoz.3.lose":"Your hand got pinched pulling the beam free", "wev.çoban.3.t":"A misty morning on the plateau", "wev.çoban.3.win":"By the sound of the bells you gathered the whole flock in the fog", "wev.çoban.3.lose":"In the fog two sheep strayed into the neighbor's flock", "wev.fırıncı.3.t":"Almshouse day", "wev.fırıncı.3.win":"A hundred loaves came out for the orphans; the blessings found their way to your purse", "wev.fırıncı.3.lose":"The oven stone cracked; the day went to repairs", "wev.katip.3.t":"The grandmother who cannot read", "wev.katip.3.win":"You wrote the old woman's letter to her son far away; she left blessings and a pouch of walnuts", "wev.katip.3.lose":"The words brought the old woman to tears; the letter was left half-written", "wev.dokumacı.3.t":"A bridal trousseau order", "wev.dokumacı.3.win":"A hidden motif was woven into the trousseau cloth; the bride's family doubled the tip", "wev.dokumacı.3.lose":"The motif came out mirrored; the cloth had to be unpicked", "wev.avcı.1.t":"Tracks in the snow","wev.avcı.1.win":"You set the trap deftly and came back laden with pelts","wev.avcı.1.lose":"Your trap stood empty; the frost bit deep","wev.avcı.2.t":"A wounded stag","wev.avcı.2.win":"You tracked it all day and brought the quarry down","wev.avcı.2.lose":"You twisted your ankle on the steep slope","wev.asker.1.t":"Night watch","wev.asker.1.win":"You spotted the thieves and put them down","wev.asker.1.lose":"You fell asleep at your post","wev.asker.2.t":"The training ground","wev.asker.2.win":"You threw every man on the field","wev.asker.2.lose":"You wrenched your shoulder in the drill","wev.şifacı.1.t":"Herb-gathering in the mountains","wev.şifacı.1.win":"You found rare roots; your remedies grew stronger","wev.şifacı.1.lose":"You brewed the wrong herb and fell ill yourself","wev.şifacı.2.t":"Fear of plague","wev.şifacı.2.win":"You calmed the people and made them take precautions","wev.şifacı.2.lose":"The people panicked and laid the blame on you","wev.müzisyen.1.t":"Summons to the lord's court","wev.müzisyen.1.win":"You recited an old epic masterfully; purses opened","wev.müzisyen.1.lose":"You lost the melody; the court went cold","wev.müzisyen.2.t":"The market square","wev.müzisyen.2.win":"You played all day; your purse filled up","wev.müzisyen.2.lose":"Your voice gave out","wev.hancı.1.t":"A noble guest","wev.hancı.1.win":"He was pleased with your hospitality and praised your name everywhere","wev.hancı.1.lose":"The wine turned sour; the guest took offense","wev.hancı.2.t":"Counting the cellar","wev.hancı.2.win":"You caught the fraud and set the cellar in order","wev.hancı.2.lose":"The cook had tricked you; the cellar stood half empty","wev.kuyumcu.1.t":"Silver inlay","wev.kuyumcu.1.win":"You worked through the night; the bracelet dazzled","wev.kuyumcu.1.lose":"Your eyes blurred and you spoiled the piece","wev.kuyumcu.2.t":"A suspect gemstone","wev.kuyumcu.2.win":"You spotted the fake at a glance; your standing rose","wev.kuyumcu.2.lose":"You bought a false stone as genuine","wev.balıkçı.1.t":"Net-mending day","wev.balıkçı.1.win":"You wove the nets strong; the next day brought plenty","wev.balıkçı.1.lose":"The twine turned out rotten","wev.balıkçı.2.t":"A voyage to far coves","wev.balıkçı.2.win":"You found a shoal in a cove no one knew","wev.balıkçı.2.lose":"The current dragged you out to open water","wev.marangoz.1.t":"An order for a mosque door","wev.marangoz.1.win":"Your carving left onlookers in awe","wev.marangoz.1.lose":"The chisel slipped and cut your hand","wev.marangoz.2.t":"Bargaining for timber","wev.marangoz.2.win":"You struck a good deal and got the wood cheap","wev.marangoz.2.lose":"They palmed rotten timber off on you","wev.çoban.1.t":"Shearing time","wev.çoban.1.win":"The fleece came off rich and full","wev.çoban.1.lose":"You cut your hand with the shears","wev.çoban.2.t":"The lost lamb","wev.çoban.2.win":"You pulled the lamb back from the cliff's edge","wev.çoban.2.lose":"The lamb was never found; its owner blames you","wev.fırıncı.1.t":"A feast-day order","wev.fırıncı.1.win":"The trays sold out before they left the oven","wev.fırıncı.1.lose":"The oven lost its heat; the dough stayed raw","wev.fırıncı.2.t":"A new recipe","wev.fırıncı.2.win":"The honey buns sold like wildfire","wev.fırıncı.2.lose":"The experiment failed; the flour went to waste","wev.katip.1.t":"A secret letter","wev.katip.1.win":"You proved discreet and won the trust of the great","wev.katip.1.lose":"The gossip was pinned on you","wev.katip.2.t":"The account books","wev.katip.2.win":"You finished the night by candlelight; the books were flawless","wev.katip.2.lose":"Your eyes tired; the lines blurred together","wev.dokumacı.1.t":"A day at the dye-house","wev.dokumacı.1.win":"The colors set just right","wev.dokumacı.1.lose":"The boiling dye scalded your hand","wev.dokumacı.2.t":"Word of palace cloth","wev.dokumacı.2.win":"You won the palace steward over with your cloth","wev.dokumacı.2.lose":"The steward turned up his nose","wev._.2.t":"Portering at the market","wev._.2.win":"The bales got carried, the sweat got shed; the purse grew a little fuller","wev._.2.lose":"The load was heavy, the earnings light","wev._.3.t":"Garden work at a mansion","wev._.3.win":"By evening the garden shone; the steward pleased, the pay in advance","wev._.3.lose":"The day ended before the work did; half the pay stayed behind","wev.demirci.5.t":"A scorched bellows hide","wev.demirci.5.w":"The hide was patched overnight and the bellows stood up by dawn; the forge never went cold","wev.demirci.5.l":"The patch did not hold; the forge died at midday","wev.tüccar.5.t":"The ledger of debts owed","wev.tüccar.5.w":"Three forgotten debts surfaced from the ledger and were collected with a smile","wev.tüccar.5.l":"The ink in the ledger had faded; the debt stayed a promise","wev.çiftçi.5.t":"A hail cloud","wev.çiftçi.5.w":"The cloud was read early and the harvest covered; the hail beat on nothing","wev.çiftçi.5.l":"The hail found the threshing floor; two days of labor lay flattened","wev.avcı.5.t":"A turncoat wind","wev.avcı.5.w":"Creeping in against the wind, the herd was arrowed before it startled","wev.avcı.5.l":"The scent carried; the plain emptied in a breath","wev.asker.5.t":"Repairing the broken wall","wev.asker.5.w":"Stone on shoulder, the breach was closed; the sergeant had the name entered in the roll","wev.asker.5.l":"The stone slipped and crushed your foot","wev.şifacı.5.t":"A poisoned wedding party","wev.şifacı.5.w":"The mushroom in the cauldron was named at the first spoonful; the whole party was saved unharmed","wev.şifacı.5.l":"The diagnosis came late; three days went to three patients","wev.müzisyen.5.t":"A wedding tune cut short","wev.müzisyen.5.w":"The snapped string was covered with a whistle; the gathering told of it for years","wev.müzisyen.5.l":"The tune stopped halfway; the drummer finished alone","wev.hancı.5.t":"The sealed storeroom","wev.hancı.5.w":"Two mixed-up deposits were told apart by their seal marks; both merchants left a tip","wev.hancı.5.l":"The deposits got mixed; the shortfall came out of your own purse","wev.kuyumcu.5.t":"The molten ingot fraud","wev.kuyumcu.5.w":"The lead heart of the ingot was caught on the touchstone; the guild was informed","wev.kuyumcu.5.l":"The fraud showed only in the crucible; the loss went into your ledger","wev.balıkçı.5.t":"A giant fish washed ashore","wev.balıkçı.5.w":"The crowd was put in order and the fish shared out; both the portion and the name grew","wev.balıkçı.5.l":"The sharing turned to a brawl; the fish did not last past its smell","wev.marangoz.5.t":"A minbar stair gone crooked","wev.marangoz.5.w":"The step was fixed by arithmetic, not by the plane; the imam climbed the minbar with confidence","wev.marangoz.5.l":"The step creaked again; the job was reopened","wev.çoban.5.t":"Salt-trough duty","wev.çoban.5.w":"The troughs went up the mountain on your back; the flock found its salt and the fleece came out glossy","wev.çoban.5.l":"A trough tipped over on the slope; the salt mixed into the soil","wev.fırıncı.5.t":"The dead starter","wev.fırıncı.5.w":"Borrowed starter from the next bakery saved the dough; no one told the difference","wev.fırıncı.5.l":"The dough would not rise; the day passed on flatbread","wev.katip.5.t":"A treaty copy in two tongues","wev.katip.5.w":"The two copies matched letter for letter; the envoys pressed their seals with easy hearts","wev.katip.5.l":"One word bore two meanings; the copy was written anew","wev.dokumacı.5.t":"A moth-eaten bolt of cloth","wev.dokumacı.5.w":"The hole was hidden under a pattern and the cloth saved; the masters said the flaw was turned to ornament","wev.dokumacı.5.l":"The hole opened at the first wash; the bolt came back","wev._.4.t":"A lost donkey notice","wev._.4.w":"From the crier description the donkey turned up on the mill road; the reward went into the pocket","wev._.4.l":"The trail proved false; the day passed on the road","wev._.1.t":"An unexpected favor","wev._.1.win":"You lent a hand and it was repaid","wev._.1.lose":"Your effort went unnoticed", "crime.yankesicilik.l":"a pickpocketing", "crime.dukkan_soyma.l":"a shop robbery", "crime.soygun.l":"a highway robbery", "crime.konak_soygunu.l":"a manor heist", "wound.0":"Bruised rib", "wound.1":"Sword wound", "wound.2":"Sprained wrist", "wound.3":"Facial wound", "whoami.crowned":"a sovereign", "whoami.fear":"a feared figure", "whoami.honor":"a man of honor", "whoami.comert":"an open-handed soul", "whoami.dindar":"a devout soul", "whoami.fame":"a renowned figure", "whoami.rep":"a respected figure", "whoami.plain":"an ordinary soul", "inv.egitim.l":"Education", "inv.savas.l":"Combat Training", "inv.zanaat.l":"Craft", "inv.sosyal.l":"Social Graces", "inv.saglik.l":"Health Care", "nbr.0":"Your neighbor offered you a warm bowl of soup.", "nbr.1":"Someone at the market pressed a few coins into your hand.", "nbr.3":"The baker pressed the day last warm loaf into your hands.","nbr.4":"An old neighbor, sweeping the doorstep, spared a blessing for you too.","nbr.5":"A caravaneer unloading his goods pressed something into your palm for your help.","nbr.7":"The bathhouse keeper let you in out of turn: 'You look weary today, plain to see.'","nbr.8":"The gardener had set aside the ripest melon at the bottom of the basket: 'This one is yours; the market does not deserve it.'","nbr.6":"The neighborhood children shared a handful of the walnuts they had gathered.","nbr.2":"A tale told aloud warmed your heart.", "fis.0":"A whisper in the bazaar: something is stirring in the month ahead…", "fis.1":"Travelers bring strange news; you will learn of it before the moon turns.", "fis.2":"A feeling settles over you — your door may be knocked upon before this month is out.", "fis.4":"At the coffeehouse a sentence broke off at the next table: your name was in it, but the rest was lost.","fis.5":"The wind carried a distant drumbeat; no one could tell where it came from.","fis.6":"The night watchman passed your door twice with his lantern; he seemed about to say something, then thought better of it.","fis.8":"A pigeon landed on the windowsill, a thread-mark on its leg; the bird flew, the mark stayed in mind.","fis.10":"An old voice in the bathhouse: the water runs differently this month — no one turned to look, but you did.","fis.11":"The street dogs barked in the same direction all night; the watchman said something passed, but could not say what.","fis.12":"They say the millstone turned by itself in the night; no flour, no wheat — only the sound.","fis.13":"The beggar at the bazaar gate took no alms today; my turn today, he said, and gave away what was in his palm — no one understood.","fis.9":"An unsealed paper slid under the door: one line, half faded — it seems to read: be ready.","fis.7":"At the market a fortune-teller looked at your face, not your palm: 'Your month is full,' she said, and walked on.","fis.3":"A cloud of dust on the horizon; word of it comes soon.", "sfx.crimeDread":" Your dreaded name froze your victim in place.", "sfx.crimeHard":" It was unexpected from one so renowned as you; the punishment was heavy.", "sfx.factionDom":" Your guild rules this banner — your word carried all the more weight.", "sfx.feastWhy":" Being a renowned figure, your feast was much talked of.", "sfx.intimWinWhy":" Your name already dreaded, a single glance sufficed.", "sfx.intimLoseWhy":" Being a beloved soul, no one took you seriously.", "evj.workerHired":"%1, %2 (%3) was hired.", "evj.profGain":"You came of age. You set out into life as a %1 — the world opened before you.", "evj.fate40":"You reached forty. When you look in the mirror, you see %1. Half your life is spent; what comes after is a matter of legacy.", "evj.fate60":"You passed sixty. Your hair has whitened, the shadow of your past grown long. In the evening of your life you are known as %1 — what will you leave behind?","evj.fate70":"You reached seventy — a span granted to few. Grandchildren at your knee, the realm knows you as %1; your age brings you reverence.","evj.fate80":"You passed eighty. You are a living witness to the age; none remain who saw what you have seen. Your name is spoken beyond being %1 — like a legend.", "evj.nemFeud":"Your enmity with %1 has turned to blood feud; now you are a relentless adversary.", "evj.nemTaunt":"%1 boasts of having beaten you; one day you will settle the score.", "evj.distrust":"%1 already distrusts you; they will not fall for your game.", "evj.propHarvest":"Your properties and settlements yielded %1 coins in income.", "evj.propHarvestW":"Your properties and settlements yielded %1 coins in income (%2 coins paid in laborers' wages).", "evj.prizeWin":"%1 seized %2!", "evj.prizeHold":"%1 held onto their dominion over %2.", "evj.workHurt":"You were injured working too hard (−%1 health); your earnings fell (%2 coins).", "evj.workSlack":"You were caught slacking off; your reputation was shaken and you earned little (%1 coins).", "evj.workWin":"%1: %2 (+%3 coins).", "evj.workLose":"%1: %2.", "evj.frontWin":"You fought for your guild at the front and prevailed (+%1 coins, reputation).", "evj.frontLose":"A hard day at the front; you were wounded.", "evj.crimeWin":"You pulled off %1 (+%2 coins).%3", "evj.crimeCaught":"You were caught! %1 coins in fines, your reputation shaken.%2", "evj.genInvest":"You made a %2 investment in %1.", "evj.factionTask":"You carried out the \"%2\" task for %1 (+%3 coins, reputation rose).%4", "evj.feast":"You held a feast for the village; your name passed from tongue to tongue.%1", "evj.intimWin":"You intimidated someone; your name became one to be feared.%1", "evj.intimLose":"Your intimidation backfired; your reputation suffered.%1", "evj.equip":"You took up %1.","evj.equipBump":"You took up %1; set aside %2.", "evj.equipQ":"You took up %1 (%2).", "evj.craft":"You crafted %1.", "evj.craftN":"You crafted %1 (×%2).", "evj.craftQ":"You crafted %1 — %2 craftsmanship!", "evj.craftNQ":"You crafted %1 (×%2) — %3 craftsmanship!", "evj.familyQuest":"Family quest completed: %1.", "evj.arcStart":"A new story has begun: %1.", "evj.helpGoal":"You lent a hand to %1's \"%2\" trouble with %3 coins; they remained grateful to you.", "evj.exploitGoal":"You exploited %1's \"%2\" hope and wrung %3 coins from it; they bore a grudge against you." };
